# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Repo-root ignore rules (see company/ai-footprint/engineering/ARCHITECTURE.md §6)
# Rules are precise and root-anchored so they never swallow source, tests or
# fixtures. Git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded,
# so directory rules below are anchored with a leading "/".
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Secrets - never commit (precise, anchored)
/.env
/.env.*
!/.env.example
/secrets/
/credentials
/credentials.*
!/credentials.schema.json
*.pem
*.pfx
*.p12
*.key
*.token
*.secret

# Legacy RC4 tool (Manage-KerberosEncryption.ps1) logs / CSV reports.
# These may contain internal AD data.
*.log
*.csv

# AuthShift outputs (may contain internal AD data) - root only
/reports/
/journal/
/snapshots/
*.authshift.html
*.authshift.json

# AI Stocktake scan outputs produced at the repo root
/out/
*.aistocktake.json
*.aistocktake.html

# AuthShift fixtures are fake by design
!tests/Fixtures/*.json

# AI Stocktake has its own ai-stocktake/.gitignore (it will become its own
# repo). Never let the rules above ignore anything under it: source, tests
# and tests/fixtures/** are always tracked. The nested ai-stocktake/.gitignore
# still applies (deeper .gitignore files take precedence).
!/ai-stocktake/**
